<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev 1996 profit up.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev 1996 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS AMEV --</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share (guilders)     4.42  vs  3.85</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			 1.90  vs  1.68</p>
<p>    Net profit				     804  vs  693</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands and Fortis AG of Belgium jointly own banking and insurance group Fortis. Analysts had forecast Fortis Amev's 1996 net profit would rise by about 16 percent to some 806 million guilders.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
